=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Identify [*p and q arms*]{color=#24578F}
- Decode a [*chromosome address*]{color=#24578F}
- Compare band positions on the same arm
- Read [*karyotype notation*]{color=#24578F}

=== layout: definitions

# Chromosome Address Terms

@body

- [*Centromere*]{color=#24578F}: constriction between the arms
- [*p Arm*]{color=#24578F}: short; p = petite
- [*q Arm*]{color=#B74300}: long; q = not p
- [*Cytogenetic Address*]{color=#24578F}: chromosome, arm, band location

