=== layout: one-panel

# Compare the Chromosome Landmarks

@body

- Chromosomes differ in size, centromere position, and banding
- Karyotypes put homologs together
- Chromosomes 1-20 are ordered mainly by decreasing size
- By historical convention, 21 precedes 22, even though 21 is smaller

=== layout: one-panel

# Tan = Genes

@body

- Gene density is not highly correlated with chromosome size
- 19 and 22: gene-rich; 4 and 5: lower gene density

![Gene Density and Chromosome Size](assets/lect10_repaired_figures/gene_density.svg)

